mode: "100644"
text: "# Launch plan templates + two worked examples\n\n## One-page launch brief (write first, share with everyone)\n```\nWHAT is launching:            [product/series/feature]\nWHO it's for:                 [audience]      WHY now: [the hook/timing]\nPRIMARY GOAL + metric:        [one goal]      LAUNCH TYPE: soft / hard / phased\nPLATFORMS (1-3):              [...]           LAUNCH DATE: [date/time + tz]\nTHE OFFER + urgency:          [credible scarcity/bonus/deadline]\nCAMPAIGN HUB (all links ->):  [waitlist/landing page URL]\nWHO OWNS WHAT:                [content / email / press / community / publish via WoopSocial]\n```\n\n## Week-by-week map (compress/expand to the runway)\n```\nW-6..-4  TEASE: problem-awareness + transformation tease; open the waitlist + hub; BTS\nW-3..-2  TEASE->PROOF: beta group, proof drops, founder story; personalized press/creator outreach\nW-1      RAMP: countdown posts, \"something's coming\", priority-access email, readiness checks\nDAY 0    LAUNCH: coordinated push (one morning), one CTA, drop/countdown/live, waitlist announce email\nW+1..+4  REINFORCE: testimonials/UGC/demos, objection content, onboarding nudges; debrief + numbers\n```\n\n## Phase x platform grid (repurpose, don't copy)\n```\nPer phase, 1-2 HERO posts + evergreen support. One 60s asset -> 9:16 TikTok + 15s IG Story + 30s LinkedIn cut.\nChannels reinforce (IG -> TikTok -> hub). All scheduled via WoopSocial (SCHEDULE_FOR_LATER, per-platform fields).\n```\n\n## Waitlist + urgency mechanics (credible only)\n```\nWaitlist promise: \"Get first access + a launch-week bonus\" (specific > \"join the waitlist\"). Referral: unique link + reward.\nUrgency: real scarcity (first 100) / meaningful bonus / honest deadline + clearly-communicated price increase.\nNEVER: resetting \"24h left\" timers, invented signup counts, fake \"selling fast\". Credible urgency converts better.\n```\n\n## Worked example 1 — indie SaaS feature, phased (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nGOAL: 300 activations in launch week. Type: phased. Platforms: X + LinkedIn. Hub: waitlist landing page (external).\nTEASE: 3 weeks of build-in-public BTS + waitlist (\"early access + founder pricing\"). LAUNCH: one Tuesday-morning\ncoordinated push, one CTA (start free), live demo. WoopSocial schedules every post; email via my ESP. REINFORCE: user\ndemos + objection threads. YIELD: activations vs 300, per-channel. No fake scarcity - founder pricing ends honestly Friday.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — small product drop, soft launch (warm studio voice)\n```\nGOAL: sell the first 100 units. Type: soft (waitlist + VIP first). Platforms: IG + email. TEASE: packaging/naming BTS,\nwaitlist with a real first-100 bonus, one link-in-bio hub. LAUNCH: a timed drop with a countdown sticker + a go-live,\none CTA. WoopSocial publishes the coordinated IG posts; checkout + emails external. REINFORCE: customer photos (UGC) +\nrestock interest. YIELD: units vs 100 + waitlist conversion. Urgency is the genuine first-100 bonus, nothing invented.\n```\n\nBoth: one goal + brief; three-phase arc as one story; credible urgency; coordinated publish via WoopSocial;\nhub/email/checkout external; measured per-channel; nothing fabricated.\n"
